{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0672_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0672_1000_014mir", "source_sha256": "235c4846dd4895d34b352e3b6b26ce738cf8991e1a59eb3aa331b4be5f60ae64", "ja": "聞いてください！　この間、静香ちゃんと翼と3人で\nクリスマスパーティーをしたんです！", "zh": "请听我说！前段时间，我和静香、翼，还有3个人一起办了圣诞派对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0672_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0672_1001_p", "source_sha256": "7c19c2e8cde1b1f89cf88ffcbaffae3fa692330a00d3bded5d1b3da2d782f2c1", "ja": "おお、とうとう！　予定が決まってから、\n毎日「楽しみだ」って言ってたアレだな？", "zh": "哦，终于啊！就是定下计划后，每天都说“好期待”的那件事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0672_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0672_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "1d6c8a064f014c66bb3ba77a251e10e6eb0bca5981b0e09edc31eca860b39c6e", "ja": "はい♪　す～っごく楽しかったですよ！\nお買い物の時から、ずっと喋って笑って、大変でした！", "zh": "是的♪　特别特别开心哦！\n从买东西的时候开始，就一直聊天、笑个不停，可热闹了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0672_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0672_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "8965535e84eb51e7ee562374a2d286c0fca7498e35cc4068ba2a1d49d3d812c0", "ja": "でも、途中で……{$P$}さんも\n一緒だったら、もっと楽しかったのにって思って……。", "zh": "不过，在途中……我就在想，要是{$P$}先生也一起去的话，肯定会更开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0672_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0672_1004_p", "source_sha256": "29f2e9ad87741c8a5be655fb833ade620939c7baddef296d8479a6f8b81114b1", "ja": "ありがとう。未来の気持ちはうれしいよ。\n来年にでも……。", "zh": "谢谢你。未来有这份心意我很高兴。\n要不等到明年……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0672_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0672_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "83dec20afd4ddf380f85d91e118204ef208108555e6ff05f93cee2aad880b2c5", "ja": "だから、改めて誘いにきました！　クリスマスは\n過ぎちゃいますけど……一緒にパーティーしませんか♪", "zh": "所以，我才特意再次来邀请你！虽然圣诞节已经过去了……要不要一起开派对？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0672_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0672_1006_p", "source_sha256": "8560d244ee3bc8bf035e0adb5ca4bf43d417865ec8ae8e8626f4f68cc315cd0e", "ja": "未来……。\nそうだな。みんなでパーティーしようか。", "zh": "未来……。\n好吧。大家一起开派对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0672_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0672_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "117197b5dc20cb3d67d9b2983839e0cf791b7f9ba2641c613b5bf445b2f383b7", "ja": "やった～！　楽しいことは何度やってもいいです\nもんね！　早速ふたりにも、声かけてこよ～っと♪", "zh": "太好了～！开心的事不论办多少次都很棒\n嘛！我这就去跟她们两个人说～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
